ale ap-\\nplications. One of the bottlenecks is the difficulty of acquiring\\nhigh-quality iris images: (1) At long distances, the resolution\\nof the acquired iris image is too low. (2) If a person stands\\noutside\", \"decision_required\": true, \"next_action_hint\": \"Call add_paper if this paper is relevant, or reject_paper if it is not relevant. Use the same arXiv ID.\"}"
